  "cause": {
    "proximate_text": "The cause of the event was an erratic gain potentiometer in the Channel 1 Upper Flux signal, [EIIS: JC], which affects the input to the Channel 1 OTDT set point calculation. This was not immediately recognized as the cause of the channel drift; therefore, it was not recognized that the input to the OTDT function was adversely impacted by the condition.",
